OL,3,GNEWSAIllegal off-road vehicles to be
OL,4,Aseized on the spot as police warn of
OL,5,A'long walk home'
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn August, three men who caused
OL,8,F"irreversible" harm to the Berwyn Site
OL,9,Fof Special Scientific Interest (SSSI)
OL,10,Fin 4x4s were convicted after videos of
OL,11,Fthem causing the damage were shared on
OL,12,FTikTok.
